{"id":"d57b5a54109bb025","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-malcev-term.md","title":"Mal'cev Term","display":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-malcev-term","aliases":["93-df-malcev-term"],"display":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-malcev-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-malcev-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_3=\\{x,y,z\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X_3=\\{x,y,z\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\">\\(p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\)</span> is the algebraic satisfaction relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed variety predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}malcev\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,y,y),x\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,x,y),y\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}malcev\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,y,y),x\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,x,y),y\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both identities are required uniformly in the whole variety. Merely naming a ternary term does not make it a Mal'cev term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}$ is the algebraic satisfaction relation of [[93-df-equational-class]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}$ is the type-indexed variety predicate of [[93-df-variety]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X_3=\\{x,y,z\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}malcev\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,y,y),x\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\langle p(x,x,y),y\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1244,"backlinks":[{"id":"f9827304d8968c8c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]]."},{"id":"d9c7505f9ccdb5ad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]]."},{"id":"172be99586e3e75f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]]."}],"outgoing":["ca7404158049be33","1e2cbe43bd24f67f","55094a403a51c25e","f0b0edbaa6696a1d"]}